NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA

This license covers the source code, the trained model weights and the
synthetic data generated by this project only.

The MIIC dataset (Microscopic Images of Integrated Circuits; Huang et al.,
"Joint Anomaly Detection and Inpainting for Microscopy Images via Deep
Self-Supervised Learning", ICIP 2021) was used during development solely to
measure calibration statistics that informed the renderer's parameters. No
part of it is redistributed in this repository, no model here is trained on
it, and it remains subject to its own non-commercial research terms.
